#tutor27
Presidency of the Federated States of the East
The honourable president in seat
Claris Suzan Audrey Jackson

Dear % &,

I am sending you this short note in sign of admiration for
your actions against the ignominious Katzar.

Thanks to your strategy, we have won great victories.

You have been able to stop the enemy advancing and given
hope back to the Littlestonian resistance who, each day
more numerous and more organised, are ready to give their
lives in the combat that unites us against dictatorship.

Your venture is noble and you must persevere.
The Katzars can feel this and it makes them nervous.
Be kind enough not to die, you are a lot more useful as a
hero than as a martyr.

One last thing : a report indicates that an undefended base
is situated to the North of your position.
Make the best use of this information.

My prayers are with you.
                                    Claris Jackson.